tickets.body:
Extend the lineage tooling (overhaul MMR-168) so each clean entry records its inputs: file, licence and role (base or reference). Add a check to tools/ci/mods.py check that fails when a clean asset lists:
- an input under DD2-modding-repo/local;
- an input matching an extracted-DD2 hash (in the local pre-push hook, as in overhaul MMR-157 a5, since the hosted runner has no DD2 files);
- a reference render used as a texture or projection source.

Checks: targeted no-game tests for each failure and for a passing entry; existing suites pass.
